425 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 372 0 R
/E (This course is a focused, advanced journey through production-grade LLM engineering, designed for experienced practitioners who want to build and deploy real-world systems. You will master Transformer architectures, fine-tuning at scale \(QLoRA, SFT, DPO\), knowledge distillation, and advanced RAG with multimodal and graph retrieval. You will build production multi-agent systems using LangGraph, MCP, A2A protocol, and Bedrock AgentCore. You will also learn LLMOps fundamentals including evaluation harnesses \(RAGAS, PromptFoo, Inspect AI\), CI/CD with eval-gated pipelines, and deployment to cloud infrastructure. By the end of this *7-month program, you will be capable of building and shipping production-grade LLM systems that reason, retrieve, and collaborate autonomously.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
